[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 10440.55, "timestamp": "02:54:00", "text": "它也进来了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10443.269, "timestamp": "02:54:03", "text": "好的。收款来了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10444.79, "timestamp": "02:54:04", "text": "好的。我就这样吧。所以这"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10446.07, "timestamp": "02:54:06", "text": "发生了。所以，我们回去吧。好的，我们开始吧"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10447.75, "timestamp": "02:54:07", "text": "既然如此，我们就先按兵不动吧。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10449.91, "timestamp": "02:54:09", "text": "现在应该又像战斗中期了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10452.309, "timestamp": "02:54:12", "text": "等等，不是该轮到Tick了吗，不是我的？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10453.91, "timestamp": "02:54:13", "text": "哦，对不起。坚持，稍等。等待。搬家了吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10456.71, "timestamp": "02:54:16", "text": "我该拿吗？哦，对不起。坚持，稍等。我的错。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10458.79, "timestamp": "02:54:18", "text": "好的。采取移动，然后任何"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10461.19, "timestamp": "02:54:21", "text": "否则勾选。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10464.469, "timestamp": "02:54:24", "text": "Ariana Dragon 的滴答声"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10466.389, "timestamp": "02:54:26", "text": "以呼吸作为奖励动作。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10469.03, "timestamp": "02:54:29", "text": "呃，是龙之贝尔夫还是触摸？如果是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10470.389, "timestamp": "02:54:30", "text": "触摸一下，嗯。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10471.75, "timestamp": "02:54:31", "text": "这是触觉。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10473.83, "timestamp": "02:54:33", "text": "好的。是的。呃，如果你挪过去就可以。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10477.11, "timestamp": "02:54:37", "text": "在这里或者那边，你可以给 Ariana"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10479.03, "timestamp": "02:54:39", "text": "这里。你将会拥有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10482.309, "timestamp": "02:54:42", "text": "我们将带给你魔法。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10489.91, "timestamp": "02:54:49", "text": "不，你是神圣而神奇的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10491.99, "timestamp": "02:54:51", "text": "是的，我不知道该如何把它转过来。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10492.389, "timestamp": "02:54:52", "text": "你。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10494.95, "timestamp": "02:54:54", "text": "哦，直接点一下就行了。穿上"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10496.63, "timestamp": "02:54:56", "text": "那个东西。如果在线，就发到聊天室里。"}]